[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/8050]Venworks - Encounters Overhaul[/url]: Fixes the open world caves and encounters that do not spawn enemies unless you are on a rare random encounter quest so are completely empty most of the time[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/8411]Fix for Walter Vanishing in MQ101 and blocking quests[/url]: If certain level lists are overridden Walter stops functioning and vanishes, this stops that[/*]
